flowchart TD
    Start([CRM Entry])
    
    Start --> Source{Source}
    
    Source -->|Marketing| Campaign[Marketing Campaigns]
    Source -->|Sales| Lead[Lead Management]
    Source -->|Support| Ticket[Ticketing]
    
    Campaign --> Lead
    Lead --> Comm[Client Communications]
    Ticket --> Comm
    
    Comm --> End([Resolution / Conversion])
